; and pre- and post-trade services, data products, and compliance tools. It also provides agency execution services and trading venues for transparent trading in global equities, ETFs, fixed income, currencies, and commodities to institutions, banks, and broker dealers; agency-based and execution-only trading; workflow technology; trading analytics; foreign exchange, futures, and cryptocurrency products. The company was founded in 2008 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"6211","sic_desc":"Security Brokers, Dealers & Flotation Companies","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","mcap":5191197184,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"NEW YORK, NY","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1592386,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":630164000.0,"rev_yoy":12.3,"eps":0.63,"eps_yoy":70.3,"ni":117593000.0,"ni_yoy":47.2,"nm":18.7,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":535977000.0,"rev_yoy":7.7,"eps":0.06,"eps_yoy":-78.6,"ni":6701000.0,"ni_yoy":-83.1,"nm":1.3,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":642839000.0,"rev_yoy":3.6,"eps":0.59,"eps_yoy":5.4,"ni":111308000.0,"ni_yoy":1.1,"nm":17.3,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":692985000.0,"rev_yoy":36.7,"eps":0.71,"eps_yoy":343.8,"ni":128117000.0,"ni_yoy":333.6,"nm":18.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-30","rev":706840000.0,"rev_yoy":12.2,"eps":0.64,"eps_yoy":1.6,"ni":119023000.0,"ni_yoy":1.2,"nm":16.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-12-31","rev":834285000.0,"rev_yoy":55.7,"eps":1.02,"eps_yoy":1600.0,"ni":176087000.0,"ni_yoy":2527.8,"nm":21.1,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2025-03-31","rev":837869000.0,"rev_